        <tr><td data-label="Course type"><strong>Diploma (for example DMLT)</strong></td><td data-label="What it is">A shorter, job-linked course. Some allow lateral entry into a degree.</td><td data-label="Check before you pay">What the certificate lets you do, and the seats for lateral entry.</td></tr>
        <tr><td data-label="Course type"><strong>B.Voc</strong></td><td data-label="What it is">A skill-linked degree with exit points at diploma level.</td><td data-label="Check before you pay">Recognition of the college and what each exit certificate is worth to an employer.</td></tr>
        <tr><td data-label="Course type"><strong>B.Pharm, BPT, MBBS, BDS</strong></td><td data-label="What it is">Professional degrees with their own regulators and entry routes. They are not BSc courses.</td><td data-label="Check before you pay">The regulator, the entrance and the fee for every year.</td></tr>
