    ICAR lists 6,002 seats across its programmes for 2025-26, and the 2026-27 bulletin says seat numbers for the new year had not yet arrived from the universities. The NTA CUET page lists only the 2026 cycle as of 12 October 2026, so read the 2027 bulletin when it appears. The CUET and EAPCET seat map is in <a href="/blog/college-degrees/cuet-eamcet-courses-for-pcb-bipc-biology-students/">CUET and EAMCET courses for PCB/BiPC students</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="regulated">Licensed careers and open careers</h2>

  <p>
    A licence sets who may practise. It also protects your title, which is why approved colleges matter.
  </p>

  <div class="comparison-grid">
