  <p class="note-line">
    The NCAHP Act, 2021 also lists biotechnologist, non-clinical microbiologist, biochemist and forensic science technologist among allied and healthcare professions. Whether a state register is open for your title is something to ask the state council. Confirm the current rules before you plan around any of them.
  </p>

  <h2 id="pay">Pay samples, with sources and their limits</h2>

